OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre revamp plans face
OL,4,Afresh delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative council leader Chris Boden
OL,7,Fsaid it was "disappointing" the vote
OL,8,Fhad been put off, but the cabinet
OL,9,Fneeded to wait until a new report was
OL,10,Fcompleted.
